cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below. Each folder's README also gives a citation for its article."
type: dataset
title: "DMARKOFF articles: data and scripts"
abstract: >-
  Data and scripts behind articles on the DMARKOFF blog about SPF and DMARC:
  a comparison of free SPF checkers against RFC 7208, a test of how mailbox
  providers handle broken SPF records, and a DNS snapshot of SPF and DMARC
  across the Tranco top 100,000 domains (October 2026). One folder per article.
authors:
